{"authored" [{"question" "q-73243" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "A particle $P$ is traveling along the $x$-axis with displacement $s(t)$ from a fixed origin $O$ given by\n\n$$\ns(t)=t{e}^{-t},\\,t\\ge 0.\n$$\n\nFind the time at which the acceleration is zero, and find the value of the velocity at this moment.\n\nTime s: {{time-s}}\n\nVelocity m per s: {{velocity-m-per-s}}" "category" "local_reconstruction" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/history-question-import-2026-10-04/import-ready/questions.json" "file_sha256" "50327f088e1802526fef61aecff55d85426669a0cf8ea00def90f5806b3d5934" "transaction" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/history-question-import-2026-10-04/import-ready/database-import/transaction.edn" "transaction_sha256" "735387c3560cc206e9e6dc540884b5be0d105253f5d3c2618709fce223388e6b" "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/history-question-import-2026-10-04/import-ready/database-import/verification.json" "basis" 552} {"question" "q-73243" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "local_reconstruction" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/history-question-import-2026-10-04/format-audit/repairs.json" "file_sha256" "0328005daa91919dd8bb81fd729228440954ec812e808e91c99da77efc57aee9" "transaction" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/history-question-import-2026-10-04/format-audit/database-repair/transaction.edn" "transaction_sha256" "571ee7e4f8997fdfae74f800edd84d0efce760607b5043aa85a8d9d81962095f" "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/history-question-import-2026-10-04/format-audit/database-repair/verification.json" "basis" 653} {"question" "q-73243" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/text "time s = $(2)+1$; velocity m per s = $-1/e^2$"] "category" "local_authored" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/history-question-import-2026-10-04/format-audit/repairs.json" "file_sha256" "0328005daa91919dd8bb81fd729228440954ec812e808e91c99da77efc57aee9" "transaction" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/history-question-import-2026-10-04/format-audit/database-repair/transaction.edn" "transaction_sha256" "571ee7e4f8997fdfae74f800edd84d0efce760607b5043aa85a8d9d81962095f" "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/history-question-import-2026-10-04/format-audit/database-repair/verification.json" "basis" 653} {"question" "q-73243" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/text "time s = $(2)-1$; velocity m per s = $-1/e^2$"] "category" "local_authored" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/history-question-import-2026-10-04/format-audit/repairs.json" "file_sha256" "0328005daa91919dd8bb81fd729228440954ec812e808e91c99da77efc57aee9" "transaction" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/history-question-import-2026-10-04/format-audit/database-repair/transaction.edn" "transaction_sha256" "571ee7e4f8997fdfae74f800edd84d0efce760607b5043aa85a8d9d81962095f" "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/history-question-import-2026-10-04/format-audit/database-repair/verification.json" "basis" 653} {"question" "q-73243" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/text "time s = $(2)+2$; velocity m per s = $-1/e^2$"] "category" "local_authored" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/history-question-import-2026-10-04/format-audit/repairs.json" "file_sha256" "0328005daa91919dd8bb81fd729228440954ec812e808e91c99da77efc57aee9" "transaction" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/history-question-import-2026-10-04/format-audit/database-repair/transaction.edn" "transaction_sha256" "571ee7e4f8997fdfae74f800edd84d0efce760607b5043aa85a8d9d81962095f" "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/history-question-import-2026-10-04/format-audit/database-repair/verification.json" "basis" 653} {"question" "q-73243" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/text "time s = $(2)-2$; velocity m per s = $-1/e^2$"] "category" "local_authored" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/history-question-import-2026-10-04/format-audit/repairs.json" "file_sha256" "0328005daa91919dd8bb81fd729228440954ec812e808e91c99da77efc57aee9" "transaction" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/history-question-import-2026-10-04/format-audit/database-repair/transaction.edn" "transaction_sha256" "571ee7e4f8997fdfae74f800edd84d0efce760607b5043aa85a8d9d81962095f" "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/history-question-import-2026-10-04/format-audit/database-repair/verification.json" "basis" 653} {"question" "q-73188" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "The position $s(t)$ of a particle at time $t$ is given by \n\n$$\ns(t)={t}^{2}-2t+8,\\,t\\ge 0.\n$$\n\nCalculate the time when the particle is stationary, and give the displacement of the particle from the origin at this time." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031422/state.json" "file_sha256" "c838dd4824375f10e4399d22f04118108b8b7c9bed1ddf4051b154cb3f3a8b91" "basis" 1213 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031422/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-73188" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The particle is stationary when its velocity is zero. So first, we need to calculate the velocity function. We can do that by taking the derivative of the position function, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}s}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({t}^{2}-2t+8) \\\\  & =2t-2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe particle is stationary when $v=0$ So, we set $v=0$ and solve for $t:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2t-2 & =0 \\\\ 2t & =2 \\\\ t & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo the particle is stationary only at $t=1.$ To find the displacement from the origin at this time, we substitute $t=1$ back into $s(t)$ and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}s(1) & ={1}^{2}-2(1)+8 \\\\  & =1-2+8 \\\\  & =7.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the particle is stationary at $t=1$ and its displacement from the origin at this time is $7.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031422/state.json" "file_sha256" "c838dd4824375f10e4399d22f04118108b8b7c9bed1ddf4051b154cb3f3a8b91" "basis" 1213 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031422/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-73188" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031422/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "98c43c20ddedd7749da132c7bb1808e868642876f4fa196c15be2f8a9c0a56cf" "basis" 1213 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031422/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-73188" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031422/state.json" "file_sha256" "c838dd4824375f10e4399d22f04118108b8b7c9bed1ddf4051b154cb3f3a8b91" "basis" 1213 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031422/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-73188" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "t=1,\\,s=10"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Dev